  "content": "<p style=\"display:flex\"><img style=\"margin-left:135px\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/226/257/beachmodded.gif\" alt=\"美丽沙滩效果\" width=\"278\" height=\"199\"> <img style=\"margin-left:8px\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/226/328/flooding.gif\" alt=\"水流蔓延\" width=\"278\" height=\"199\"></p><p style=\"display:flex\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/balm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"margin-left:8px\" src=\"https://mods.twelveiterations.com/img/requires-balm.png\" alt=\"需要安装Balm\" width=\"260\" height=\"80\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmods.twelveiterations.com%252fsponsor\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"margin-left:26px\" src=\"https://mods.twelveiterations.com/img/new-patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon支持我们\" width=\"550\" height=\"80\"></a></p><p>本模组调整了在水边挖掘沙子时的水流物理效果，避免产生难看的流动水痕迹。这意味着您可以放心挖掘需要的沙子，而不用担心破坏周围环境。</p><p>本模组支持NeoForge、Fabric和Forge平台。需要同时安装<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/balm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Balm</a>前置库。</p><h3><img src=\"https://mods.twelveiterations.com/img/features-header.png\" alt=\"功能特色\" width=\"836\" height=\"40\"></h3><ul>\n<li>破坏水边的沙子会立即生成水源方块</li>\n<li>挖掘沙子时水体会自动填满附近的坑洞</li>\n<li>不再被流动水推动或留下不自然的挖掘痕迹</li>\n<li>注意：由于本模组会免费生成水源，不适用于需要限制水资源的场景</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1001/697/meme.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"730\" height=\"592\"></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
